---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site.js";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Animesh"
  description="A little about me and the things I am learning and building."
>
  <div class="site-shell page-intro compact-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="page-title" style="margin-top:1rem">A little about me</h1>
  </div>

  <section class="site-shell about-page" aria-labelledby="about-intro-title">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <h2 id="about-intro-title" class="editorial-lead">
        I am an engineering student who likes understanding how things work.
      </h2>

      <div class="about-body">
        <p>
          Most of my time goes into learning, building things, and trying to
          understand the parts of software that are usually hidden behind
          abstractions.
        </p>

        <p>
          I like writing software, but I am also interested in what happens
          underneath it. Networks, protocols, operating systems, databases,
          backend systems, and all the small decisions that make software
          actually work.
        </p>

        <p>
          A lot of what I learn starts with a simple question. I usually end up
          reading about it, trying something myself, breaking it a few times,
          and then writing about it once I understand it a little better.
        </p>

        <p>
          That is more or less what this website is. A place to keep track of
          things I am learning, things I have built, ideas I am thinking about,
          and things I do not want to forget.
        </p>

        <p>
          I am also interested in entrepreneurship and the process of turning
          an idea into something people can actually use. I am still figuring
          out what that looks like, so I would rather document the process than
          pretend I already have it figured out.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-links" aria-labelledby="elsewhere-title">
      <p id="elsewhere-title" class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</p>
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      <a href={site.github} rel="me noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      <a href={site.linkedin} rel="me noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
